sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SPA as React SPA
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant Sanctum
    participant DB

    User->>SPA: Enter email + password
    SPA->>API: POST /api/login { email, password }
    API->>API: LoginRequest::authorize() + validate()
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>API: User record
    API->>Sanctum: Hash::check(password, hash)

    alt Invalid credentials
        Sanctum-->>API: false
        API-->>SPA: 422 { errors: { email: [...] } }
        SPA-->>User: Show field error
    else Valid credentials
        Sanctum-->>API: true
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO personal_access_tokens
        DB-->>API: Token string
        API-->>SPA: 200 { data: { user, token }, message: "Logged in" }
        SPA->>SPA: Store token in AuthStore
        SPA-->>User: Redirect to dashboard
    end
